WEBVTT

00:00:02.087 --> 00:00:05.887
The beginning breeze

00:00:06.292 --> 00:00:10.160
Delivers this message

00:00:10.596 --> 00:00:19.163
"Because I have always believed in you"

00:00:20.306 --> 00:00:20.773
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:28.881
The Story of Saiunkoku
We are standing in the land
we dreamed of back then

00:00:28.881 --> 00:00:29.176
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:00:29.415 --> 00:00:36.685
We feel weak at the knees a little,
gazing over the scenery

00:00:36.922 --> 00:00:41.052
But please don't look back

00:00:41.193 --> 00:00:45.220
Because you've decided to go forward

00:00:45.431 --> 00:00:49.527
I looked up into the sky to see
the rainbow with seven colors

00:00:49.802 --> 00:00:53.238
Can you see it too?

00:00:53.505 --> 00:00:57.407
The beginning breeze

00:00:57.810 --> 00:01:01.473
Delivers this message

00:01:01.914 --> 00:01:10.083
I will watch over you as
you go forth to chase your dreams

00:01:10.456 --> 00:01:18.659
The dancing winds in the blazing sun

00:01:19.098 --> 00:01:28.769
Fly forth strongly
with the wings of freedom

00:01:33.912 --> 00:01:37.746
Sa Province is one of the eight
provinces that make up Saiunkoku.

00:01:38.384 --> 00:01:41.751
In that province's capital city of Koren,
in a room of a particular residence...

00:01:42.221 --> 00:01:45.019
...a man is seen gloating.

00:01:45.591 --> 00:01:49.823
This man is Advisor Sa, Enjun
Sa's younger brother, Chusho Sa.

00:01:51.030 --> 00:01:55.763
The time has come. Elder brother,
it's been one year since you died.

00:01:56.235 --> 00:02:00.194
You can't imagine all the fighting there's
been in the struggle for clan leadership.

00:02:00.639 --> 00:02:02.937
However, that'll soon end.

00:02:03.275 --> 00:02:05.243
With the new governors held in check,
the one who controls...

00:02:05.311 --> 00:02:07.677
...the seal and charm...

00:02:08.113 --> 00:02:10.581
...will be the one to become
the new clan leader.

00:02:13.085 --> 00:02:15.918
First, the elimination of Ensei Ro.

00:02:16.689 --> 00:02:19.590
We're from the border office
of Sairi! Don't move!

00:02:28.000 --> 00:02:30.230
You cannot talk your way
out of the crimes of...

00:02:30.302 --> 00:02:32.293
...breaking into the border office
on two separate occasions...

00:02:32.371 --> 00:02:34.339
...last summer and this spring!

00:02:35.441 --> 00:02:37.033
And there are more
charges against you.

00:02:37.109 --> 00:02:39.543
This past month, you've been assaulting
neighboring cities and towns...

00:02:39.611 --> 00:02:42.045
...committing robbery of money
and valuables, and even murder.

00:02:42.114 --> 00:02:43.741
You shall confess to
everything you've done...

00:02:43.816 --> 00:02:46.114
...Little Rascal King of
the Murderous Blades.

00:02:47.986 --> 00:02:51.251
I have no knowledge of anything other
than breaking into the border office.

00:02:51.857 --> 00:02:54.325
Well, I guess there's no way outta
this. I'll go with them for a bit.

00:02:54.593 --> 00:02:56.993
I'm afraid you're not the
only one coming with us.

00:02:57.329 --> 00:02:59.797
You're Little Whirlwind of the
Murderous Blades, aren't you?

00:03:00.599 --> 00:03:02.965
Don't! Don't resist, Seiran.

00:03:05.804 --> 00:03:07.772
Next, we get the new governors.

00:03:08.807 --> 00:03:14.643
I don't care if the kid gets killed.
The problem is the other one.

00:03:17.850 --> 00:03:20.410
The Hong Clan wouldn't
take her death lightly.

00:03:21.086 --> 00:03:25.284
So we'll just have to lure her into our
arms. Sakujun will be suitable for this.

00:03:26.558 --> 00:03:28.492
The time has come!

00:03:28.560 --> 00:03:31.028
Once we get rid of elder brother's
remaining granddaughter...

00:03:31.096 --> 00:03:33.064
...his bloodline will come to an end.

00:03:33.632 --> 00:03:34.826
On the other hand, even if I die...

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:37.130
...I'll do everything to ensure my
bloodline goes on.

00:03:37.336 --> 00:03:39.770
You who died first have lost.

00:03:40.973 --> 00:03:44.067
I will surpass you, Enjun Sa.

00:03:48.080 --> 00:03:53.040
Companionship in Travel,
Compassion in Life

00:04:12.171 --> 00:04:13.661
You hit a government official...

00:04:13.739 --> 00:04:15.707
...and used his seal without
authorization while he was down?

00:04:15.841 --> 00:04:18.537
I told him I was in a hurry to go
and make a direct appeal to the king.

00:04:18.911 --> 00:04:22.039
But he kept searching for faults with
me and refused to let me through.

00:04:22.448 --> 00:04:24.416
You stupid idiot!

00:04:25.050 --> 00:04:27.712
If anything happens to her
ladyship, I'll kill you.

00:04:28.187 --> 00:04:32.954
Have a little faith in her. Princess
remained hidden and didn't come out.

00:04:33.725 --> 00:04:35.693
If she were with us,
both governors would easily...

00:04:35.761 --> 00:04:38.127
...fall into the clutches of the Sa Clan.

00:04:39.465 --> 00:04:42.161
She understood what the
best course of action was.

00:04:42.868 --> 00:04:46.395
This is the result of Princess'
appraisal of the situation as governor.

00:04:47.005 --> 00:04:50.372
We are merely her assistants, and it's
Princess's job to make the decisions.

00:04:52.244 --> 00:04:55.407
I'm not in the same position as you are.
My job is to protect the governors.

00:04:56.081 --> 00:04:58.106
Why did you bring me here, too?

00:05:00.419 --> 00:05:03.115
If you were your usual self,
this wouldn't be a problem, but...!

00:05:03.589 --> 00:05:04.556
What?

00:05:04.656 --> 00:05:06.214
The Murderous Blades.

00:05:09.495 --> 00:05:12.931
Who'd have thought that
we'd hear that name now?

00:05:13.565 --> 00:05:15.396
If you lose control and
go on a rampage...

00:05:15.467 --> 00:05:17.958
...I'm about the only one
who can stop you.

00:05:18.670 --> 00:05:21.639
Letting you escape with Princess in
that state would only make me worry.

00:05:22.541 --> 00:05:24.566
You're annoying, as always.

00:05:24.977 --> 00:05:28.572
Don't worry. Knowing Princess, we'll
be able to meet up with her in Kinka.

00:05:40.225 --> 00:05:42.819
Hey, Princess. There are so many
delicious things here!

00:05:43.128 --> 00:05:44.220
Can I go buy some?

00:05:45.764 --> 00:05:50.201
It's a very lively town, isn't it?
Wow! There's a used book store!

00:05:50.769 --> 00:05:54.671
My Lady, are you not tired? Shall
I buy some ice or something?

00:05:55.774 --> 00:06:00.768
Shurei. When I'm feeling better,
I'll see to your needs again.

00:06:11.189 --> 00:06:13.919
They're here. That was pretty quick.

00:06:18.130 --> 00:06:21.327
I didn't believe it at first,
but it's the real you, Ensei Ro.

00:06:21.833 --> 00:06:24.825
Hey! It's Sojeey! Long time no see.

00:06:25.537 --> 00:06:27.198
Address me as Lord Sojun!

00:06:27.272 --> 00:06:31.971
Since they were with you, that kid and
girl must be the new governors.

00:06:32.844 --> 00:06:34.812
Why don't you ask them?

00:06:35.447 --> 00:06:37.415
Not that it matters if they're imposters.

00:06:37.649 --> 00:06:39.617
What's important is the
charm and seal.

00:06:39.885 --> 00:06:43.753
As long as I have those, I
can name anyone governor.

00:06:44.856 --> 00:06:47.154
But those very things were
nowhere to be found.

00:06:47.526 --> 00:06:49.517
Tell me! Where did you hide them?

00:06:49.928 --> 00:06:51.896
Who knows?

00:06:53.799 --> 00:06:55.790
Threatening you isn't gonna help.

00:06:56.501 --> 00:06:57.627
What happened?!

00:06:57.703 --> 00:07:00.968
In the short time since I last saw you,
you've become much more reasonable.

00:07:04.776 --> 00:07:07.006
Shut up! As long as I
have you in custody...

00:07:07.079 --> 00:07:09.479
...it doesn't matter what sort
of new governors come in.

00:07:10.015 --> 00:07:11.880
And I don't care if you don't
tell me where they're hidden.

00:07:11.950 --> 00:07:13.781
You can try shipping them hidden
or whatever...

00:07:13.852 --> 00:07:16.480
...but ultimately, they'll come in
to Koren. And that's our territory.

00:07:16.588 --> 00:07:18.749
As long as we get rid
of you and Yushun Tei...

00:07:18.824 --> 00:07:22.851
...we can take all the time
we need to look for them.

00:07:23.729 --> 00:07:28.098
You really have gained some
wisdom, Sojeey. Who taught you?

00:07:30.569 --> 00:07:35.029
Damn! If I could, I wanna kill
you with my own two hands.

00:07:35.641 --> 00:07:38.769
That's impossible.
Not with your skills.

00:07:40.846 --> 00:07:42.780
In that case,
I'll starve you to death.

00:07:42.848 --> 00:07:45.339
What?! But that's the
worst way to die!

00:07:45.784 --> 00:07:48.014
While I'm at it, here's a little
something you might wanna know.

00:07:48.086 --> 00:07:52.045
Kinka's already under the
control of the Murderous Blades.

00:07:53.091 --> 00:07:58.859
That's right. That legendary vicious
band of thieves is now working for us.

00:07:59.598 --> 00:08:01.930
But I understood that group
was wiped out a long time ago.

00:08:02.000 --> 00:08:05.527
There was a survivor.
The second-in-command at that.

00:08:06.104 --> 00:08:07.571
Meisho.

00:08:10.609 --> 00:08:13.271
Well, if you think you can
escape, go ahead and try.

00:08:18.116 --> 00:08:19.913
So that's Sojun Sa?

00:08:19.985 --> 00:08:21.953
Yeah. And it seems like someone
troublesome...

00:08:22.020 --> 00:08:23.612
...has been giving him ideas

00:08:24.056 --> 00:08:25.648
So it seems.

00:08:25.724 --> 00:08:29.524
Sojeey learned and used the word
"starve" for the first time, after all.

00:08:31.997 --> 00:08:36.957
Meisho, he says. That's how he knew
the nickname Little Rascal King.

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:39.334
Seiran.

00:08:39.938 --> 00:08:40.927
What?

00:08:41.273 --> 00:08:43.503
You're gonna hunt down the ghosts
from the past, aren't you?

00:08:43.809 --> 00:08:48.109
I am. I'll send anyone threatening
to reveal the past to her ladyship...

00:08:48.714 --> 00:08:50.682
...to the very depths of hell.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:54.849
We'll meet up with Princess in
the town of Kinka, as planned.

00:08:55.554 --> 00:08:57.749
If the Murderous Blades
are in control there...

00:08:57.823 --> 00:09:00.815
...as assistant to the governors,
I need to weed them out quickly.

00:09:01.593 --> 00:09:03.322
What about Eigetsu and Korin?

00:09:03.395 --> 00:09:06.387
You mind if we stay here a little longer
to come up with a plan about that?

00:09:07.866 --> 00:09:10.664
When everything's over, let's
all drink Gan Lu tea together...

00:09:11.236 --> 00:09:13.329
...delicious tea that Princess makes.

00:09:23.749 --> 00:09:25.717
Are you feeling all right?

00:09:25.984 --> 00:09:27.747
Where's Shurei?

00:09:27.819 --> 00:09:31.721
She got away. Mr. Seiran and Mr.
Ensei are in the dungeon here.

00:09:32.791 --> 00:09:36.386
You should have left me
behind and made your escape.

00:09:37.763 --> 00:09:39.321
Korin.

00:09:39.598 --> 00:09:43.090
Why do you think Mr.
Ensei only hid Shurei?

00:09:44.102 --> 00:09:44.659
I dunno.

00:09:45.270 --> 00:09:46.532
If we get caught...

00:09:46.605 --> 00:09:48.835
...then we're better off
being caught as a foursome.

00:09:49.441 --> 00:09:51.409
The new governors are a
thirteen year-old boy...

00:09:51.476 --> 00:09:53.740
...and a seventeen year-old girl.

00:09:54.279 --> 00:09:56.543
And their assistants are the
previous governor, Mr. Ensei...

00:09:57.082 --> 00:09:59.243
...and a specially assigned
officer, Mr. Seiran.

00:09:59.317 --> 00:10:01.478
The Sa Clan is searching for
this foursome.

00:10:02.287 --> 00:10:04.619
I'm a stand-in for Shurei?

00:10:06.424 --> 00:10:08.756
Shurei is a lady of the
direct line of the Hong Clan.

00:10:09.494 --> 00:10:11.962
Normally, you'd think of a well-bred
and sheltered lady, right?

00:10:12.898 --> 00:10:15.833
Although Shurei might
not like me saying this...

00:10:16.301 --> 00:10:18.769
...you fit that image much
better than she does.

00:10:21.573 --> 00:10:23.871
Thanks to that, they're taking
extremely good care of you...

00:10:24.476 --> 00:10:26.444
...and we save having to
pay for accommodations.

00:10:26.511 --> 00:10:28.775
We also prevent anyone
from pursuing Shurei...

00:10:28.847 --> 00:10:31.315
...so all kinds of good things
have come outta this, you see?

00:10:31.449 --> 00:10:34.577
You know, I'm beginning
to feel that now, too.

00:10:35.187 --> 00:10:37.155
Let's do our best to fool them here.

00:10:37.823 --> 00:10:42.260
Yes. I'll do my best for Shurei's sake.

00:10:45.797 --> 00:10:47.560
Wh-What is it?

00:10:47.632 --> 00:10:51.398
Korin. You're much prettier
with that type of expression.

00:10:51.803 --> 00:10:53.771
H-How impertinent!

00:10:58.109 --> 00:11:03.069
The Story of Saiunkoku

00:11:08.620 --> 00:11:11.248
Your Majesty. I have a little
something I'd like to ask of you.

00:11:11.556 --> 00:11:12.545
Denied.

00:11:12.624 --> 00:11:15.718
Well, I don't need you to hear me out.
I'll just go and do it anyway.

00:11:16.528 --> 00:11:18.155
Go? Where?

00:11:18.230 --> 00:11:20.790
To Sa Province. To deliver this.

00:11:23.335 --> 00:11:25.303
The Sa Clan leader's ring!

00:11:25.971 --> 00:11:29.668
So you're the one who had it.
You scheming, evil old man.

00:11:30.075 --> 00:11:32.043
Well, I'll be off then.

00:11:32.911 --> 00:11:34.970
Just who do you intend
to hand that ring to?

00:11:35.413 --> 00:11:37.108
No need to worry.

00:11:37.182 --> 00:11:39.150
I won't do anything nasty like
bully new officials...

00:11:39.217 --> 00:11:41.344
...with bright futures ahead of them.

00:11:42.087 --> 00:11:47.047
I'm not the one who will choose. This
will. I can promise you that much.

00:11:48.827 --> 00:11:52.456
My, I haven't seen Shurei in so long.

00:11:53.064 --> 00:11:56.795
Maybe I'll have some of her homemade
steamed buns while I'm there.

00:12:03.808 --> 00:12:07.266
This is all the money I have.
I'll have to watch my spending.

00:12:07.779 --> 00:12:10.077
No matter what happens, you're
to get to Kinka. Got that?

00:12:11.650 --> 00:12:13.845
I have to get to Kinka, no matter what.

00:12:17.756 --> 00:12:18.688
Hey!

00:12:18.757 --> 00:12:19.689
I'm sorry!

00:12:19.758 --> 00:12:23.888
You idiot! Look what you've done!
That wine cost twenty silver coins!

00:12:24.529 --> 00:12:26.963
Twenty silver coins? There's
no way it cost that much.

00:12:27.132 --> 00:12:29.100
Well, it did.

00:12:31.803 --> 00:12:33.771
Damn. Is this all you've got?

00:12:33.905 --> 00:12:36.135
Give that back! I'll cover the expense...

00:12:36.775 --> 00:12:40.006
...but I don't believe that
wine was that expensive.

00:12:40.145 --> 00:12:41.476
What?!

00:12:42.847 --> 00:12:45.714
I also don't believe
it to be that valuable.

00:12:46.751 --> 00:12:50.278
Who's that?!
And who are you?

00:12:50.855 --> 00:12:54.655
Who am I? Why, as you
can see, I'm a merchant...

00:12:54.893 --> 00:12:56.417
...and a member of the
Merchants Guild.

00:12:56.494 --> 00:12:58.121
Th-The Merchants Guild?

00:13:02.734 --> 00:13:04.759
That's right! The Merchants Guild!

00:13:10.642 --> 00:13:12.701
You guys are the new governors?

00:13:13.011 --> 00:13:14.911
But you're just a couple of kids.

00:13:14.980 --> 00:13:18.848
For starters, we'll test them and
make sure they're the real ones.

00:13:20.151 --> 00:13:22.619
In the Seven Scriptures... what
were the Nine Fundamentals...

00:13:22.687 --> 00:13:25.315
...for ruling over the country as
revealed to King Yu by Kishi?

00:13:26.324 --> 00:13:28.451
The Five Elements, the Five Businesses,
the Eight Objects of Government...

00:13:28.526 --> 00:13:30.994
...the Five Arrangements, Royal
Perfection, the Three Virtues...

00:13:31.062 --> 00:13:33.724
...the Examination of Doubts, the various
Verifications, and the Five Happiness.

00:13:33.798 --> 00:13:35.823
Name the book, section,
and page number...

00:13:35.900 --> 00:13:37.265
...in the Scriptures where I will find that.

00:13:37.869 --> 00:13:39.803
The Book of History, the
section on the Great Plan...

00:13:39.871 --> 00:13:43.773
...from the third line on page forty-two
to the twelfth line of page forty-three.

00:13:44.876 --> 00:13:47.344
I see. Now, girl.

00:13:47.712 --> 00:13:51.011
Write down here the work that marked
the beginning of the brilliant career...

00:13:51.349 --> 00:13:52.543
...of poet Mei Senshi.

00:13:52.617 --> 00:13:53.447
You can't be serious!

00:13:53.518 --> 00:13:55.850
You want her to write down that
long piece in its entirety?

00:13:55.920 --> 00:13:57.820
Is there a problem with that?

00:13:57.889 --> 00:14:01.916
Uh, well... she's not
feeling well right now.

00:14:02.127 --> 00:14:04.095
Please hand that to me.

00:14:18.476 --> 00:14:22.776
That's enough. I think it is safe
to recognize them as genuine.

00:14:23.114 --> 00:14:24.012
Don't you,
Sojun?

00:14:24.182 --> 00:14:25.444
Yeah.

00:14:27.485 --> 00:14:30.249
All that remains are the charm
and the Governor's seal.

00:14:30.789 --> 00:14:33.280
Why not force it outta these two?

00:14:34.025 --> 00:14:35.993
No. They probably don't know.

00:14:36.294 --> 00:14:39.786
They likely have been given as
little information as possible.

00:14:40.231 --> 00:14:42.495
For example, go to Kinka.

00:14:43.435 --> 00:14:45.403
Or something of the sort.

00:14:46.271 --> 00:14:48.000
As I thought.

00:14:48.073 --> 00:14:51.304
I didn't expect you to be carrying
such a treasure in the first place.

00:14:51.676 --> 00:14:54.611
That's why we took the initiative
and took control of Kinka.

00:14:55.580 --> 00:14:58.105
The merchant capital
of Sa Province, Kinka.

00:14:58.516 --> 00:15:02.077
All material goods entering
Koren go through there.

00:15:02.687 --> 00:15:05.087
No doubt you thought to hide
them in with some other goods...

00:15:05.156 --> 00:15:07.124
...and slip them in that way.

00:15:07.192 --> 00:15:10.491
That's Meisho, the new leader of
the Murderous Blades, for you.

00:15:11.062 --> 00:15:15.965
Even without the charm and the seal,
you can still be of use to us.

00:15:16.568 --> 00:15:18.536
Especially the girl.

00:15:19.370 --> 00:15:21.361
Sojun, where's your younger brother?

00:15:21.973 --> 00:15:24.908
You mean Sakujun?
He's still in Kinka.

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:28.179
He says he's scared because bandits
have been known to attack the highway.

00:15:29.280 --> 00:15:32.113
In that case, it would probably be
faster to take these two to him.

00:15:32.650 --> 00:15:35.118
Young lady, your future elder brother...

00:15:35.186 --> 00:15:38.451
...will see to it that you reach
Kinka safely, so please rest easy.

00:15:39.557 --> 00:15:41.525
What do you mean by that?

00:15:41.626 --> 00:15:46.393
The Sa main house wishes for
you to become Sakujun's wife.

00:15:48.533 --> 00:15:52.196
Now then, I'll go on ahead
and return to Kinka.

00:15:52.637 --> 00:15:56.801
You're to stay here
until Ensei Ro escapes.

00:15:57.108 --> 00:15:58.132
Escapes?!

00:15:58.209 --> 00:16:00.473
Oh he will.
Don't ever doubt it.

00:16:02.780 --> 00:16:06.409
Huh, you're going to
Kinka on your own? But...!

00:16:06.551 --> 00:16:08.781
Yes, I know that it's dangerous.

00:16:09.354 --> 00:16:11.584
So I was thinking of going
through the Merchants Guild...

00:16:11.656 --> 00:16:14.181
...and have you introduce me to
a caravan headed for Kinka.

00:16:14.259 --> 00:16:15.726
I see.

00:16:16.027 --> 00:16:18.495
After all, the Merchants
Guild can be trusted.

00:16:18.563 --> 00:16:21.430
Not to mention, there's no fear
of being attacked by bandits.

00:16:22.367 --> 00:16:24.767
Because it's said that the guild
will be sure to retaliate.

00:16:25.170 --> 00:16:26.228
Yes.

00:16:26.304 --> 00:16:29.034
It's only natural to try and
have bands of thieves destroyed.

00:16:29.641 --> 00:16:32.667
And we'll also claim any valuables
they may have hidden away.

00:16:33.444 --> 00:16:35.912
So unless they're an exceptionally
foolish band of thieves...

00:16:36.247 --> 00:16:39.273
...they won't attack the
Merchants Guild's caravans.

00:16:40.285 --> 00:16:41.980
Exactly.

00:16:55.934 --> 00:16:58.129
Young lady! You have
very discerning taste!

00:16:58.503 --> 00:17:01.563
That erhu's a truly exceptional
item from Koku Province.

00:17:02.640 --> 00:17:04.232
May I try it out a bit?

00:17:04.409 --> 00:17:05.842
Of course. Please do.

00:17:32.971 --> 00:17:36.202
That was amazing! You're a
truly accomplished player!

00:17:36.574 --> 00:17:39.407
Out of respect for your skill,
I'll give you a special discount.

00:17:39.944 --> 00:17:41.912
Five silver pieces. What do you think?

00:17:42.313 --> 00:17:45.146
I don't want it. I don't have that
much on me in the first place. But...!

00:17:46.351 --> 00:17:46.976
But?

00:17:47.585 --> 00:17:49.212
I'll buy it
for one silver piece.

00:17:49.554 --> 00:17:51.522
Young lady, that's too cruel.

00:18:02.300 --> 00:18:04.268
I beg your pardon for interrupting.

00:18:06.070 --> 00:18:08.038
You want that erhu, right?

00:18:08.473 --> 00:18:12.807
If you play five tunes for me that
I request, I'll buy it for you.

00:18:13.745 --> 00:18:15.235
And the titles of those tunes?

00:18:15.313 --> 00:18:20.546
Tosho Ki, Ouou Den, Saigu
Shu, Biwa Ki, Soyo Ki.

00:18:21.519 --> 00:18:23.487
They're all difficult pieces.

00:18:23.888 --> 00:18:25.082
You can't play them?

00:18:25.156 --> 00:18:26.885
Sure I can.
I'll take on your challenge.

00:18:33.731 --> 00:18:35.289
That was wonderful.

00:18:35.566 --> 00:18:36.555
Why, thank you.

00:18:37.268 --> 00:18:38.860
And I'm not only talking
about your performance.

00:18:38.936 --> 00:18:41.928
You bargained him down, and bought
the erhu for two silver pieces...

00:18:42.006 --> 00:18:44.474
...pocketing the remaining
three silver pieces.

00:18:44.942 --> 00:18:49.379
You promised five silver pieces,
so I'm not giving any back. Umm...!

00:18:50.515 --> 00:18:53.348
Senya Rin. You can call me Senya.

00:18:59.057 --> 00:19:01.218
This is the Sakyo branch
office of the Merchants Guild.

00:19:01.826 --> 00:19:03.794
Now then, shall we enter?

00:19:04.128 --> 00:19:05.959
Do you also have business here?

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:10.433
I finished my work here and
am about to return to Sa Province.

00:19:11.169 --> 00:19:13.637
So I thought I'd have them
take care of the preparations.

00:19:14.872 --> 00:19:18.569
Which means, he is also
a merchant of the Guild.

00:19:19.110 --> 00:19:20.236
Aren't you coming in?

00:19:20.545 --> 00:19:21.978
Just a moment!

00:19:28.019 --> 00:19:33.047
Ah, Mister Rin, you're most welcome.
Someone will show you the way shortly.

00:19:35.560 --> 00:19:39.792
Well then, think of that erhu
as me and take good care of it.

00:19:40.465 --> 00:19:42.433
Uh, yeah.

00:19:43.768 --> 00:19:46.999
Now then, young lady, what
is your business here?

00:19:47.572 --> 00:19:51.133
Right. I was hoping to join
a caravan going to Kinka.

00:19:52.844 --> 00:19:55.210
I beg your pardon,
but do you have a pass?

00:19:55.513 --> 00:19:58.914
Ah, yes. Here it is.

00:20:01.319 --> 00:20:05.688
Wh-Why this is...! I-I beg your
pardon! I will show you the way.

00:20:09.360 --> 00:20:12.227
You will be seeing the Sakyo Regional
Director of the Shi Provincial Branch...

00:20:12.296 --> 00:20:14.059
...of the Merchants Guild.

00:20:14.132 --> 00:20:16.100
Why such an important person?

00:20:17.902 --> 00:20:20.632
I received this pass from
Senior Secretary Kou.

00:20:21.439 --> 00:20:24.135
And it has the Kou family emblem
of mandarin ducks and flowers.

00:20:24.642 --> 00:20:26.610
I was told that, with it,
I should be able...

00:20:26.677 --> 00:20:29.145
...to pass through most checkpoints
without being searched.

00:20:33.718 --> 00:20:35.686
Please, come in. I'm Kaku...

00:20:35.753 --> 00:20:38.722
...the Regional Director
of the Sakyo Branch office.

00:20:44.162 --> 00:20:46.630
I heard that your companions
have been taken into custody.

00:20:48.199 --> 00:20:51.362
There is nothing that happens in
this city that we're unaware of.

00:20:53.337 --> 00:20:55.305
What is it that you wish?

00:20:55.840 --> 00:20:59.105
I want to be added to a caravan
headed for Kinka. That's all.

00:21:01.212 --> 00:21:03.680
Are you going to leave
your companions behind?

00:21:06.651 --> 00:21:09.711
Right now, the only thing I'm
able to do is go to Kinka.

00:21:11.255 --> 00:21:16.249
I understand. If that is your
wish, then we shall see it done.

00:21:18.229 --> 00:21:22.188
You look confused.
The explanation lies in your token.

00:21:24.035 --> 00:21:26.503
But I thought this was
a standard travel pass.

00:21:27.505 --> 00:21:32.169
That's where you're wrong.
That emblem has a special feature.

00:21:39.083 --> 00:21:40.311
This is...!

00:21:40.384 --> 00:21:42.852
It's called the luminous
seven-colored paint.

00:21:42.987 --> 00:21:44.352
It's a very special item that
only merchants...

00:21:44.422 --> 00:21:46.117
...under the direct control
of the Hong Clan...

00:21:46.190 --> 00:21:48.658
...have successfully
manufactured and possess.

00:21:49.293 --> 00:21:50.783
The Hong Clan.

00:21:50.862 --> 00:21:52.830
If a person carrying a token...

00:21:52.897 --> 00:21:55.365
...bearing the Kou family crest made
with this paint should come to us...

00:21:55.433 --> 00:21:57.901
...we're to help that person regardless of
what else we may be doing at the time.

00:21:58.603 --> 00:22:02.403
It's a direct request from the Hong Clan's
leader as well as the proxy clan leader.

00:22:06.410 --> 00:22:10.312
And in return, the Hong Clan will
surrender the manufacturing process...

00:22:10.715 --> 00:22:14.242
...as well as the rights to derivative
works, to the Merchants Guild.

00:22:15.219 --> 00:22:18.188
After stubbornly refusing, despite
many years of negotiations...

00:22:18.256 --> 00:22:21.783
...they've agreed to give those rights
in return for your protection.

00:22:23.261 --> 00:22:25.229
Uncle Kuro.

00:22:26.364 --> 00:22:28.332
Now, what would you like to do?

00:22:31.302 --> 00:22:35.796
My wish is unchanged. Please find me a
position in a caravan heading for Kinka.

00:22:36.641 --> 00:22:38.609
I don't mind if it's menial work.

00:22:40.011 --> 00:22:41.876
Very well.

00:22:53.691 --> 00:22:55.659
What are you doing here?

00:22:55.726 --> 00:22:58.786
I heard that there's a girl
wanting to join a group to Kinka...

00:22:59.397 --> 00:23:02.628
...so I replied that I would take her
as my personal maid, that's all.

00:23:02.967 --> 00:23:04.958
Personal maid?! Not menial work?!

00:23:05.703 --> 00:23:08.365
They say through companionship in
travel, we find compassion in life.

00:23:09.507 --> 00:23:11.475
I hope we'll get along.

00:23:12.310 --> 00:23:14.073
I understand. Your personal maid.

00:23:15.279 --> 00:23:18.271
Yes, that's right. I haven't
asked you your name yet.

00:23:19.850 --> 00:23:23.513
M-Me? My name is Korin.

00:23:24.622 --> 00:23:27.989
I see. Pleased to meet you, Korin.

00:23:30.628 --> 00:23:35.725
You've always led a very carefree life
and right now

00:23:35.866 --> 00:23:42.430
Amidst this rain
what sort of dreams are you chasing?

00:23:42.540 --> 00:23:47.603
And while you are fighting
loneliness somewhere

00:23:47.712 --> 00:23:52.706
You must be holding back
the tears too

00:23:53.784 --> 00:23:58.244
You say you'll be fine alone

00:23:59.790 --> 00:24:04.921
You are just like me

00:24:05.663 --> 00:24:10.191
Even if we have to take
the longer way around

00:24:10.267 --> 00:24:16.172
We somehow still prefer this route

00:24:17.141 --> 00:24:22.943
Whenever I feel happy or glad

00:24:23.047 --> 00:24:27.916
I will always think of you

00:24:29.053 --> 00:24:41.727
I believe that the colorful seasons will
deliver this feeling of mine to you

00:24:45.202 --> 00:24:45.603
Next Episode

00:24:45.603 --> 00:24:47.872
Next Episode
To get to Kinka, I'm now a maid for
a young master of the Rin family...

00:24:47.872 --> 00:24:49.340
Next Episode
Bolt Out of the Blue
To get to Kinka, I'm now a maid for
a young master of the Rin family...

00:24:49.340 --> 00:24:52.109
Next Episode
Bolt Out of the Blue
...but somehow this young master
reminds me of someone.

00:24:52.109 --> 00:24:52.476
Next Episode
Bolt Out of the Blue

00:24:52.476 --> 00:24:54.011
Next Episode
Bolt Out of the Blue
He's handsome, somewhat
removed from the norm...

00:24:54.011 --> 00:24:55.069
He's handsome, somewhat
removed from the norm...

00:24:55.279 --> 00:24:57.577
...and making advances
towards me?!
